  <div class="container">
    <div class="content-text">
      <p>161. <strong>The controversy elevates and raises the person.</strong></p>
      <p>The controversy elevates and raises the person because <strong>“man is the tree of the field”</strong> [Deuteronomy 20]. A tree on the ground cannot rise alone, only when flooding waters come, lifting it. Controversy is called water, as in <strong>“They surrounded me like water all day; they encircled me together”</strong> [Psalms 88].</p>

